@TaskManagerApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5133

### Register (then cookie is set for subsequent calls in compatible clients)
POST {{TaskManagerApi_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "demo",
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

###
POST {{TaskManagerApi_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "demo",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

###
GET {{TaskManagerApi_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/me

###
GET {{TaskManagerApi_HostAddress}}/api/Tasks

